  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development, as a result of its position and scale would be an incongruous and uncharacteristic addition, dominating the host property and failing to appear appropriately subservient and subordinate to the original house.  It would also detract from the outlook of the neighbours at no.11 and no.15 Hereford Road, appearing as an unduly overbearing and visually intrusive feature to the detriment of the living conditions of the occupiers of that property.  The proposal does not therefore comply with adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations or the Residential Extension Guidelines SPD."
